# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Tolerance represents the maximum permissible difference
# between two debtor balances for them to be treated
# as matched.
#
# Examples:
# 0.00 = Exact match required
# 0.01 = Difference of 1 paisa/cent permitted
# 1.00 = Difference of 1 currency unit permitted
#
# IMPORTANT:
# Both source files must use the same currency and
# comparable balance conventions.

